OL,3,GNEWSAPolice apologise over train       
OL,4,Aknifeman failings                      
OL,6,FCambridgeshire Police has admitted     
OL,7,Fmissing opportunities "that may have   
OL,8,Fprevented" the attempted murders of 14 
OL,9,Fpeople.                                
OL,11,FDetectives have linked an alleged      
OL,12,Fassault in Peterborough on 27 September
OL,13,F2025 to Anthony Williams, 33, who went 
OL,14,Fon to stab his victims weeks later.    
OL,16,FTen of the attacks took place on a     
OL,17,FLondon-bound train shortly after it    
OL,18,Fleft Peterborough station on 1 November
OL,19,Fthat year, with four happening in the  
OL,20,Fhours before.                          
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
