OL,3,GNEWSAPolice apologise over train       
OL,4,Aknifeman failings                      
OL,6,FLeighton Hammett, the force's assistant
OL,7,Fchief constable, said: "When we look at
OL,8,Fthe handling of all the incidents and  
OL,9,Fthe contact with various agencies, it  
OL,10,Fis clear there were opportunities that 
OL,11,Fmay have prevented this tragic         
OL,12,Fincident."                             
